course: dictionary
lesson: 3901
title: Friendliness
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Friendliness is a noun. It comes from friendly, and it names the quality of being kind, warm and nice to others, the way a good friend is. Add -ness to friendly and you get the name for that quality.
explain: «Her friendliness makes everyone welcome» is the kind of line you might read in a school report. It tells you she is kind and warm, so new people feel at home. Ask yourself: what does her friendliness do? It makes people feel welcome.
explain: Friendliness can belong to a person, a town or an animal. «A bot's friendliness is the same for everyone» means the bot is warm to every person in the same way. A dog shows friendliness when it wags its tail and comes over to say hello.
fact: Friendliness is a noun, the name of a quality.
fact: «Friendliness» means being kind, warm and nice to others, like a friend.
fact: Schools value friendliness because it helps new pupils feel welcome.
fact: «A bot's friendliness is the same for everyone» means it treats everyone with the same warmth.
exercise: «Her friendliness makes everyone welcome.» What does friendliness mean? | Being sad when others are happy | Being tall and strong | *Being kind, warm and nice to others | Being very loud at parties
exercise: A new pupil joins your class. Which action shows friendliness? | Ignoring them all day | *Showing them where the toilets are and sitting with them at lunch | Shouting at them to go away | Hiding their bag
exercise: Which word in «The dog's friendliness made it a joy to visit» is the noun that means being kind and warm? | dog's | made | *friendliness | visit
test: What is a sign of friendliness in a dog? | Growling at every visitor | Running away from people | *Wagging its tail and coming to say hello | Hiding under the bed
test: Why might «Her friendliness makes everyone welcome» appear in a school report? | Because it says she is always late | *Because it praises her for being kind and warm to others | Because it says she has lost her bag | Because it says she should be quieter
exam: Which word means being kind, warm and nice to others, like a friend? | Loneliness | *Friendliness | Sadness | Tiredness
